# Launching / focusing a desktop application.
# The {application} slot is open-vocabulary; the loader drops any value listed
# in application.blacklist so the generic "open ..." phrasings do not hijack
# utterances that belong to other skills (see application.blacklist).
[please] (launch|start|open|run|fire up) {application}
[please] (launch|start|open|run) [the] (app|application|program) {application}
(can|could) you (launch|start|open|run|fire up) {application} [for me]
i (want|need) to (launch|start|open|run|fire up) {application}
(pull up|bring up|boot up) {application}
[go ahead and] (launch|start|open|run) {application}
